  "full_text": "so uh Davis seems to be the the grim reaper of the the the vile people I don't know Jefferson Davis whether they know it or not Jefferson Davis was in charge of the South the vile I guess maybe he was trying to win but anyway so dad dad worked on a nuclear missile and it exploded And dad worked at Washington Public Power in the Contracts Administration. And they had a bond default. I don't know if it was his fault. You know, dad worked at Tucson Wastewater Management. So, like, if there's a flood, maybe the vile people die. If there's a gas attack, I don't know. at Ticketmaster. I had a lot of failed projects, but I didn't take them down. I worked at a deli, and they kept telling me to take temperature readings, and the temperatures were in violation, and I caused that store to get closed. Maybe. And I worked at Graphic Technologies. It was a toner company, toner refill toner company. And they started putting chips on printers and I could do some of them. I couldn't do them all. And that was the end of that company. There was a physics girl. Well, she's she's finished now. I don't know if I took her down or something. I wasn't trying to. So like. God said if he makes me king I have to kill the vile people so I wasn't realizing the hard way haha anyway, so",
